title: "qgemv-roofline: a quantized GEMV kernel ladder measured against its own bandwidth roof"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22164007"
abstract: >-
  Twelve CUDA kernels and a Triton implementation of the batch-1 LLM decode
  GEMV over ggml q8_0 and q4_0 weights, measured on five NVIDIA GPUs spanning
  sm_60 to sm_89 against a bandwidth ceiling the harness measures for itself.
